📌簡介：
本期教學分享如何從零開始，使用開源專案 Tiny11Builder 安全地剝離 Windows 11 (26H2) 官方原版鏡像中的冗餘組件與後台遙測服務，親手構建專屬於您的極致純淨版系統（Tiny11）。為了節省大家的時間，我也提前構建了標準版、Core 極限精簡版等多個現成 ISO 鏡像，供大家直接下載使用。

📌Description:
Learn how to safely strip away bloatware and background telemetry services from the official Windows 11 (26H2) ISO from scratch using the open-source project Tiny11Builder, creating your own ultra-clean custom OS (Tiny11). To save you time, I have also pre-built several ready-to-use ISO versions (including Standard and Core editions) for direct download.
